note addr a2 (an OM-2 unit): a text as an unsized view argument of a called and of an inline function,
note and `part` of a text. Printed: get v 0 * 256 + len v through a call (0x6106), the same through an
note inline function, and the first byte and length of part msg 2 3 (0x6303).
text msg "abcdef"

fn bytes t view uchar * to ulong
ret add mul ulong get t 0 256 len t
end

fn ibytes t view uchar * to ulong inline
ret add mul ulong get t 0 256 len t
end

fn main to ulong
mark 66
hx bytes msg
hx ibytes msg
hx bytes part msg 2 3
mark 69
ret 0
end
